menu "Meadow COMMS Project Build Configuration"

    config ENABLE_DIAGNOSTIC_THREAD
        bool "Enable diagnostic thread"
        default n
        help
            This option enables the diagnostic thread for monitoring system performance.

    config ENABLE_DETAILED_HEAP_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Enable detailed heap diagnostics"
        default n
        help
            This option enables detailed heap diagnostics to monitor memory usage and detect leaks.

    config ENABLE_DETAILED_TASK_DIAGNOSTICS
        bool "Enable detailed task diagnostics"
        default n
        help
            This option enables detailed task diagnostics to monitor task performance and detect issues.

    config ENABLE_PERFORMANCE_LOGGING
        bool "Enable performance logging"
        default n
        help
            This option enables performance logging to track system metrics.
endmenu